---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Affiliate disclosure">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    <p>
      We may earn a commission when you purchase through our links, at no additional cost to you.
    </p>
    <p>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</p>
    <p>
      Authorized affiliate links lead directly to the retailer or its approved affiliate service. If
      no authorized affiliate link is available, we use an ordinary permitted retailer link. We do
      not create affiliate IDs or hide destinations behind misleading redirects.
    </p>
    <p>
      Discount calculations use recorded listing history. Commission eligibility does not create a
      historical baseline or replace our qualification rules. Social promotional posts include #ad.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outbound clicks are recorded as aggregate events. A click does not establish that a sale
      occurred or that a commission was earned. Only independently verified commission records count
      as revenue.
    </p>
    <p>Demonstration destinations lead to example.com and do not generate real commissions.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
